  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "6e4803ce-e083-44d6-bd83-d448edf7e74e",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a pergunta e ligue a frase em espanhol ao apoio em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "71e5560f-8241-4e34-b3a4-cbe417b20826",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe o convite na cena.</p><p><strong>¿Quieres cenar mañana?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Você quer jantar amanhã?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/061475ee2b70461982c9bd691b283f73_b01-quieres-cenar-manana.png?Expires=1794099545&Signature=ukuGy0-e~rCEtVN7ZDqXd6ovXJEcmbG9oqa4spPrBbQIbRl5cUNFkJeGVzBamz~gq4foo-QvXUnz~wzli1EBY26Rhf5PqHDci-tXzPBQ4OQZKos1xcYKDvz89i65F0l7ejVwKaFl4rQSwR6WsUutVVXof~keVTxz6yUDXqy5IzWfXYgerUlPU~cWu2YFoM0e-t1vejOnj9FhMY8QJo3airdinMkUr-UDgq7Eu935R~nRaEYWdIMADd8VVm1yo~r-0YlyfgXGaZZbhC5BHTubccukXkqvK7C0PypYvjGZHub7HXqFSFJsPlW~THp-CedR1Dq-PY8jTgEnixMjRbHOkQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
