    {
      "id": "752ecb31-9a27-4242-975b-913587c3d7dd",
      "title": "Escute a frase de novo e note que a outra pessoa ainda precisa responder.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3208a2e6-22ee-41b0-a49c-11d5046fc116",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Quieres...?</strong> abre o convite e deixa espaço para a resposta da outra pessoa.</p><p>Em <strong>¿Quieres cenar mañana?</strong>, o plano ainda está aberto.</p><p>Essa forma funciona bem em mensagens rápidas e combinações curtas do dia a dia.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7f8b39239a1846adbadb242d22edc01b_b01-quieres-cenar-manana.mp3?Expires=1794099545&Signature=XNWkPyssSBi9BC8hDwpeyh~4T4663hrzxmc1qhHrHax98R5QCLO38NCxGxKB~AxRdnEsKQ0Ha8-0v9lx2ZP2Wjm7jkxFFVEUpIpsi6gMQSTnaS2zWq~AUKXzT1FZGq4F3nBZW0kM2x3-HcU8Zv-yqa5VfTqKzrb2-H4dJEfbZTt4o9qXVj1F0cfP7NAWzoFH30-AlOIdnDSePgRhLDIq7oMkuRrQBRFh2XWOixArPnBGnI8WelbD0aN47M7F~emELNinSRwmviGIPMO08-EEabKEOZDwD2tYsz0ab26k3rhqogto-oDKFSVEChWw2WhmQebP7acP2NsmiXN2eUQaaw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f77acc8a-ef03-4097-a015-87a933bc6600",
      "title": "Escute a frase e perceba que agora o plano já aparece como algo dos dois.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c15b221b-f2a5-4d0c-8583-5d4494465d97",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora observe um plano já encaminhado.</p><p><strong>Vamos a cenar mañana.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Vamos jantar amanhã.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c5cd2b22efb74370a183ae39a940f986_b03-vamos-a-cenar-manana.mp3?Expires=1794099545&Signature=SaCKcjGaVDCTmsIylb6oAGEwsqWyf7-RDU2VUYU569EndjxX1GIMEzDB8nJBU-RAqKA5TAO8UbwOHvBY0DpYBQrKOFkMSnkMZiOeaR6jX3FvJN2k-uCya1Ssq1G3TLt4EapPBlcAzABGR0CL~XlnOs6tgzPue6bqxeO1kSkbUs5ik0FS3Np2bOuHRJWYIROScW9IceXqRNSZWIiQxIPsdg~oPu8T21tdEBeCa9ER-GLUsczqIfDAyp-aac3Sx8FxAgJwu3jFHdfq7nmbshNze9tNaIWR6KgYnSYX1kY1Z~bUduIdYRzbxthdo4lyAXML7E2svF22D6x7L-rKOgXVKw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c229201c-317d-45e1-a94d-46d1ee2d8162",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e compare esta frase com a pergunta inicial.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "fcc32cf0-7cc9-4887-a374-a7505e2787f1",
          "textContent": "<p>Com <strong>vamos a...</strong>, quem fala já coloca o plano como algo compartilhado.</p><p>Em <strong>Vamos a cenar mañana.</strong>, a conversa sai da pergunta e passa para o combinado.</p><p>Essa forma aparece quando os dois já veem uma opção possível.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c5cd2b22efb74370a183ae39a940f986_b03-vamos-a-cenar-manana.mp3?Expires=1794099545&Signature=SaCKcjGaVDCTmsIylb6oAGEwsqWyf7-RDU2VUYU569EndjxX1GIMEzDB8nJBU-RAqKA5TAO8UbwOHvBY0DpYBQrKOFkMSnkMZiOeaR6jX3FvJN2k-uCya1Ssq1G3TLt4EapPBlcAzABGR0CL~XlnOs6tgzPue6bqxeO1kSkbUs5ik0FS3Np2bOuHRJWYIROScW9IceXqRNSZWIiQxIPsdg~oPu8T21tdEBeCa9ER-GLUsczqIfDAyp-aac3Sx8FxAgJwu3jFHdfq7nmbshNze9tNaIWR6KgYnSYX1kY1Z~bUduIdYRzbxthdo4lyAXML7E2svF22D6x7L-rKOgXVKw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "79129cb6-0a0f-49ea-8dcb-bd3db17c2bb3",
      "title": "Escute a resposta e observe como ela rejeita o hoje, mas mantém o convite vivo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f31b9c3e-63ad-4e03-962a-0a70bfddbdf2",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora observe uma resposta que ajusta o horário.</p><p><strong>Hoy no puedo, pero mañana sí.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Hoje não posso, mas amanhã sim.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e8c3f6dbbca043cbbc142e2c1d9050a0_b05-hoy-no-puedo-pero-manana-si-v2.mp3?Expires=1794099545&Signature=I-JekcbuOGenKMQGy5iJK5GLyotzTXdvrpyQidZ~G~hk9~vnv9H4U8XdNVLRfwBUQlsvLlbvR~0mPJiNiHWPT-RRx8JjOXTgmS9Mh45afyIYBFQoSD3g4aRNHTeF4fL8tG0eoxEMcsHRAOoFf~izJVAJWh9wstWjXjeaSaCG-Pw8dlkN4y120YaRR7WoxXJYqSJj94zn~bqNjur5VIv3cP1CMhGNI5PIIzQuD5zuINIrE0CsEwz80IpzWnt~HuhRZVAo6BFLKuazKge2S1exq49SwFB7sTSvAg~V4cfNGqQRQCkFj4QgLqICbz5wpN0RovdHuo9SB1~hGXbZSOjhtg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "05c16a7a-33b8-45bf-a6e6-72c26082bd42",
      "title": "Escute a frase mais uma vez e note que a pessoa não encerra o plano.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6f312871-873f-4348-be7d-7ac37b8e8908",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Hoy no puedo</strong> fecha este momento.</p><p><strong>Pero mañana sí</strong> abre outra opção logo em seguida.</p><p>Essa resposta ajuda a mover o plano para outro horário sem quebrar a conversa.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e8c3f6dbbca043cbbc142e2c1d9050a0_b05-hoy-no-puedo-pero-manana-si-v2.mp3?Expires=1794099545&Signature=I-JekcbuOGenKMQGy5iJK5GLyotzTXdvrpyQidZ~G~hk9~vnv9H4U8XdNVLRfwBUQlsvLlbvR~0mPJiNiHWPT-RRx8JjOXTgmS9Mh45afyIYBFQoSD3g4aRNHTeF4fL8tG0eoxEMcsHRAOoFf~izJVAJWh9wstWjXjeaSaCG-Pw8dlkN4y120YaRR7WoxXJYqSJj94zn~bqNjur5VIv3cP1CMhGNI5PIIzQuD5zuINIrE0CsEwz80IpzWnt~HuhRZVAo6BFLKuazKge2S1exq49SwFB7sTSvAg~V4cfNGqQRQCkFj4QgLqICbz5wpN0RovdHuo9SB1~hGXbZSOjhtg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8dedbe75-4ce9-471b-a57b-9f62f0c5a136",
      "title": "Passe pelos três cartões finais e observe como o plano vai da pergunta inicial até o novo combinado.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "06c0d663-51a2-4990-8543-97afb31fb979",
          "textContent": "<p>Na saída do trabalho, a conversa pode começar com um convite curto.</p><p><strong>¿Quieres cenar mañana?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7f8b39239a1846adbadb242d22edc01b_b01-quieres-cenar-manana.mp3?Expires=1794099545&Signature=XNWkPyssSBi9BC8hDwpeyh~4T4663hrzxmc1qhHrHax98R5QCLO38NCxGxKB~AxRdnEsKQ0Ha8-0v9lx2ZP2Wjm7jkxFFVEUpIpsi6gMQSTnaS2zWq~AUKXzT1FZGq4F3nBZW0kM2x3-HcU8Zv-yqa5VfTqKzrb2-H4dJEfbZTt4o9qXVj1F0cfP7NAWzoFH30-AlOIdnDSePgRhLDIq7oMkuRrQBRFh2XWOixArPnBGnI8WelbD0aN47M7F~emELNinSRwmviGIPMO08-EEabKEOZDwD2tYsz0ab26k3rhqogto-oDKFSVEChWw2WhmQebP7acP2NsmiXN2eUQaaw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "9e57900f-51fb-43ea-abd1-f066d78ad97d",
          "textContent": "<p>Se o horário não funcionar, a resposta pode mover o plano sem encerrar a conversa.</p><p><strong>Hoy no puedo, pero mañana sí.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e8c3f6dbbca043cbbc142e2c1d9050a0_b05-hoy-no-puedo-pero-manana-si-v2.mp3?Expires=1794099545&Signature=I-JekcbuOGenKMQGy5iJK5GLyotzTXdvrpyQidZ~G~hk9~vnv9H4U8XdNVLRfwBUQlsvLlbvR~0mPJiNiHWPT-RRx8JjOXTgmS9Mh45afyIYBFQoSD3g4aRNHTeF4fL8tG0eoxEMcsHRAOoFf~izJVAJWh9wstWjXjeaSaCG-Pw8dlkN4y120YaRR7WoxXJYqSJj94zn~bqNjur5VIv3cP1CMhGNI5PIIzQuD5zuINIrE0CsEwz80IpzWnt~HuhRZVAo6BFLKuazKge2S1exq49SwFB7sTSvAg~V4cfNGqQRQCkFj4QgLqICbz5wpN0RovdHuo9SB1~hGXbZSOjhtg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "50ea9d64-e91b-4e49-b7be-7a9e1e0bef99",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando os dois já aceitam a nova opção, o combinado fica claro.</p><p><strong>Vamos a cenar mañana.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c5cd2b22efb74370a183ae39a940f986_b03-vamos-a-cenar-manana.mp3?Expires=1794099545&Signature=SaCKcjGaVDCTmsIylb6oAGEwsqWyf7-RDU2VUYU569EndjxX1GIMEzDB8nJBU-RAqKA5TAO8UbwOHvBY0DpYBQrKOFkMSnkMZiOeaR6jX3FvJN2k-uCya1Ssq1G3TLt4EapPBlcAzABGR0CL~XlnOs6tgzPue6bqxeO1kSkbUs5ik0FS3Np2bOuHRJWYIROScW9IceXqRNSZWIiQxIPsdg~oPu8T21tdEBeCa9ER-GLUsczqIfDAyp-aac3Sx8FxAgJwu3jFHdfq7nmbshNze9tNaIWR6KgYnSYX1kY1Z~bUduIdYRzbxthdo4lyAXML7E2svF22D6x7L-rKOgXVKw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    }
